    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background Story</h2><br>The world is waiting for you to save it, but all you want to do is lazy. Due to you just won a billion dollars and were suddenly summoned to another world. Who has the motivation to become a hero when you could just live a carefree life?<br><br>Unfortunately, the gods had other plans. They threw you directly into this new world, promising that if you help solve their \u201ca little\u201d troubles, they\u2019ll let you return home or enjoy wealth and prosperity here.<br><br>To survive without worries, you must diligently complete the tasks assigned by the gods.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Card battle with wits and courage<br></li><li>Board game elements that test luck and judgment<br></li><li>Growable card library and character<br></li><li>Career features for mixed experiences</li></ul>",
